        <profileDesc>
            <creation/>
            <abstract>
                <p>This  short text is a commentary on chapter 76 of the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1340EnochE">Book of Enoch</ref>. It is attested as part of  <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3850MashafaM">Maṣḥafa miṭata bǝrhānāta samāy</ref>. 
                    The commentary contains a slightly adapted text of chapter 76 on the winds and a summary of the content, which groups the winds according to their characteristics.</p>
            </abstract>
